#format http://ns.nuke24.net/TEF/Formats/SyntaxV0.3
# External vocabulary terms used by mappings and the generic dialect.

=namespace http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#
short-description: RDF syntax vocabulary.

=namespace http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#
short-description: RDF Schema vocabulary.

=namespace http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#
short-description: XML Schema datatypes.

=type http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property
short-description: The class of RDF properties.

=attribute http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type
short-description: The subject is an instance of the object class.

=type http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class
short-description: The class of RDF classes.

=type http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Datatype
short-description: The class of RDF datatypes.

=attribute http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment
short-description: A human-readable description of a resource.

=attribute http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label
short-description: A human-readable name for a resource.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer
short-description: An integer literal.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean
short-description: A boolean literal.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string
short-description: A string literal.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date
short-description: A calendar date literal.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime
short-description: A date and time literal.

=datatype http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal
short-description: A decimal literal.
